Volt Labs, episode 13: "The Evil Mirror" (2026). Original characters, story, pictures and music. Part of the Void Mart universe.

Pictures: drawn in code (canvas 2D) with the Volt Labs kit (channel/brand/lab.js, channel/brand/labkit.js), the movement helpers (channel/brand/travel.js) and the shared toon kit (channel/brand/toon.js, channel/brand/vmkit.js). The mirror, the twins' goatees and glow, and the receipt are drawn in film.js.
Fonts: Bungee (The Bungee Project Authors), Fredoka (The Fredoka Project Authors) and VT323 (Peter Hull), SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Voices: ElevenLabs text-to-speech, model eleven_v4.
  Dr. Vera Volt: "LAB Vera Volt" and Cleo: "LAB Cleo" (ElevenLabs Voice Design, made for this show). Evil Vera and Evil Cleo: the same voices, with a light mirror filter in tools/mix.py; the two Cleos in unison are one take, doubled.
Sound effects: generated with ElevenLabs Sound Effects (prompts in sfx/prompts.json, some from earlier episodes). The lab room tone is generated in tools/mix.py.
Music: original score for the Volt Labs band (tools/band.py, cued in tools/score.py) played with CC0 samples from VSCO 2 Community Edition and VCSL.
